  Every string the app shows a person.

  In composeResources rather than the Android module's res/values: the UI is shared
  commonMain Compose, which cannot see an Android resource at all. These generate
  Res.string.* accessors and are resolved against the device locale on both platforms,
  so one file localises Android and iOS together rather than two that drift apart.
-->
