    <string name="about_body">Travel is hard enough without the search being hard too. %1$s is a meta-search engine: it gathers every flight on your route into one place, so a single search replaces checking site after site. Stays and rental cars sit beside them, with every price shown in the currency and region you choose. Our aim is a simple one — the right fare, found quickly, for travellers anywhere in the world.</string>
